# Orchestrator TypeScript

## Keep stage agents thin

Stage agents under `orchestrator/agents/` should stay thin wrappers around prompts and I/O. Prefer existing helpers over duplicating logic:

- `withLocalAgent` / `withCloudAgent` from `orchestrator/lib/sdk.ts`
- `streamRunWithProgress` (and related streaming helpers) for run lifecycle
- Manifest helpers from `orchestrator/lib/manifest.ts` (`loadManifest`, `requireFacadeFile`, `requireExtractionTarget`, etc.)

## State and caching

Persist pipeline state under `orchestrator/.state/` (e.g. seam manifests keyed by ticket id). Do not invent a parallel state location.

## MOD-25 special cases

Do **not** hardcode MOD-25-specific paths (e.g. `legacy/harness/sla_capture.php`) except where the code already deliberately special-cases MOD-25. New tickets should use manifest-driven paths.
